WEBVTT

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.713
or should I say, 
personned -- space flight.

00:07:35.906 --> 00:07:39.976
All of my life I have sought
to understand the universe

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.489
and find answers to these questions.

00:07:43.505 --> 00:07:45.338
I have been very lucky

00:07:45.362 --> 00:07:49.419
that my disability has not been
a serious handicap.

00:07:49.443 --> 00:07:54.082
Indeed, it has probably given me
more time than most people

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.376
to pursue the quest for knowledge.